e stresses and strains of modern life","chinese":"现代生活的紧张和压力"}]},{"id":"stress:o:92cc5ca70968","label":"n.","definitionZh":"压力","glossesEn":["physical pressure"],"examples":[{"english":"to put or impose stress on sth","chinese":"给某物加压"},{"english":"to be under stress","chinese":"受到应力"},{"english":"a stress of 500 kg","chinese":"500千克的压力"}]},{"id":"stress:o:d479635e1d4b","label":"n.","definitionZh":"强调","glossesEn":["emphasis"],"examples":[{"english":"she lays or puts or places stress on punctuality","chinese":"她非常注重守时"},{"english":"a great deal of stress has been laid on this fact","chinese":"这个事实已经得到了极大重视"}]},{"id":"stress:o:657cf17a8286","label":"n.","definitionZh":"重音","domains":["Linguistics"],"examples":[{"english":"to put or place the stress on sth","chinese":"把重音放在某音节上"},{"english":"in ‘strategic’ the stress falls on the second syllable","chinese":"“strategic”一词的重音在第二个音节上"}]},{"id":"stress:o:8295059399ad","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"强调","glossesEn":["emphasize"],"examples":[{"english":"to stress the importance of sth","chinese":"强调某事物的重要性"},{"english":"it must be stressed that this disease is very rare","chinese":"必须着重指出，这种病很罕见"},{"english":"‘I want it done very neatly,’ she stressed","chinese":"她强调说，“我希望这件事做得非常干净利落”"}]},{"id":"stress:o:af0e473e07ed","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"重读","domains":["Linguistics"],"examples":[{"english":"the final syllable is stressed","chinese":"最后一个音节要重读"}]},{"id":"stress:o:7b80758768c8","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"施压于","glossesEn":["put physical pressure on"],"examples":[{"english":"this type of workout stresses the knee joints","chinese":"这种锻炼增加膝关节的压力"}]},{"id":"stress:o:5cf25aee29ce","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"使焦虑不安","glossesEn":["make anxious"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"driving in cities really stresses me","chinese":"在市内开车让我非常紧张"}]},{"id":"stress:o:c8956a68da99","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"担心","registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"stop stressing about your exams","chinese":"别再担心考试了